<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  Par			   O/N = 3.40%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  1.28%			 T/N = 2.55%</p>
<p>		   Dec  2, 1996			Nov 29, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  4.43%	1 month forward =  5.79%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  6.30%	2 month forward =  7.32%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  6.82%	3 month forward =  7.60%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  7.58%	4 month forward =  8.34%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  8.04%	5 month forward =  8.51%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  8.06%	6 month forward =  8.45%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
